WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.959 --> 00:00:05.412
Hey youtubers it’s charlie and yesterday
in my episode 10 video I asked you to submit

00:00:05.412 --> 00:00:07.440
all your walking dead questions.

00:00:07.440 --> 00:00:10.320
Generally speaking everyone was most interested
in talking about lizzie, because we saw some

00:00:10.320 --> 00:00:16.330
things that tied up a few bigger mysteries
from the first half of the season.

00:00:16.330 --> 00:00:17.970
Quick shout out to this week’s giveaway
winner.

00:00:17.970 --> 00:00:20.970
Congratulations to Farida Thomson, you win
a $20 amazon giftcard.

00:00:20.970 --> 00:00:23.339
I’ll be reaching out to you on your channel
for details.

00:00:23.339 --> 00:00:25.250
Don’t worry if you didn’t win.

00:00:25.250 --> 00:00:28.159
Round 3 starts next sunday in my episode 11
video.

00:00:28.159 --> 00:00:30.589
I’m also doing a weekly game of thrones
giveaway whenever that starts too.

00:00:30.589 --> 00:00:34.070
Eventually I might even have t-shirts or something
to give away.

00:00:34.070 --> 00:00:37.219
So careful for spoilers in these questions
if you haven’t seen the episode yet, but

00:00:37.219 --> 00:00:38.410
let’s get started.

00:00:38.410 --> 00:00:43.320
Question Number 1 - Jesse Wade asks Did you
think that Lizzie would have, either by accident

00:00:43.320 --> 00:00:47.179
or on purpose, suffocated baby Judith while
trying to keep her quite in the woods?

00:00:47.179 --> 00:00:48.179
﻿

00:00:48.179 --> 00:00:49.929
I definitely thought she was trying to smother
her.

00:00:49.929 --> 00:00:53.359
You could see her kind of slowly tune out
and her just covering judith’s mouth turned

00:00:53.359 --> 00:00:54.359
into smothering.

00:00:54.359 --> 00:00:55.359
It was really unsettling to watch.

00:00:55.359 --> 00:00:56.370
I think it was partially unintentional.

00:00:56.370 --> 00:01:00.730
She didn’t want to kill judith, but it’s
like when a little kid hits another one to

00:01:00.730 --> 00:01:03.460
get them to stop crying and it only makes
things worse.

00:01:03.460 --> 00:01:06.861
Lizzie just wasn’t processing that by closing
her hand around judith’s mouth she’d eventually

00:01:06.861 --> 00:01:07.990
suffocate her.

00:01:07.990 --> 00:01:12.299
Her brain just isn’t connecting those dots.

00:01:12.299 --> 00:01:19.270
Question 2 - Ymir asks How long do you think
it will be before Lizzie (the sociopath) kills

00:01:19.270 --> 00:01:21.110
someone in the group?

00:01:21.110 --> 00:01:24.649
I don’t think it’s going to happen this
season, but I do think she’ll kill more

00:01:24.649 --> 00:01:25.659
walkers.

00:01:25.659 --> 00:01:29.689
Eventually someone is going to have to openly
address the issue that she’s gone a little

00:01:29.689 --> 00:01:32.029
crazy before something really bad happens.

00:01:32.029 --> 00:01:40.299
So I think Lizzie will continue to do really
effed up stuff that no one really notices.

00:01:40.299 --> 00:01:44.219
Except for Carol.

00:01:44.219 --> 00:01:49.200
Question 3 - DavijoMan asks Is Lily really
dead?

00:01:49.200 --> 00:01:53.490
Yes, I think that’s what we’re meant to
believe based on Tara’s speech.

00:01:53.490 --> 00:01:57.729
She didn’t explicitly state that Lilly was
dead, but she was out of bullets and she got

00:01:57.729 --> 00:01:58.729
swarmed.

00:01:58.729 --> 00:02:08.649
Tara kind of trailed off when she was mid-sentence,
so I think she watched while lilly got eaten.

00:02:08.649 --> 00:02:12.830
Question 4 - Jonah Armitage asks What is Terminus?

00:02:12.830 --> 00:02:15.230
Is that supposed to be Alexandria?

00:02:15.230 --> 00:02:19.730
So there are two distinct places that the
groups go including alexandria which is the

00:02:19.730 --> 00:02:22.182
safe zone and the sanctuary, which is where
the saviors are.

00:02:22.182 --> 00:02:26.160
The episode was a little confusing because
the word ‘sanctuary’ kept getting used.

00:02:26.160 --> 00:02:29.160
But in the comic books, they go to alexandria
first.

00:02:29.160 --> 00:02:34.080
I think the alexandra storyline started around
issue 69, and the sanctuary storyline didn’t

00:02:34.080 --> 00:02:35.910
start till around issue 104.

00:02:35.910 --> 00:02:39.900
So considering that I think the terminus is
meant to be the sanctuary and they’ll split

00:02:39.900 --> 00:02:44.460
the groups with some going to alexandria and
some going to the sanctuary.

00:02:44.460 --> 00:02:47.900
Question 5 - Commander sloanne asks What would
have happened if Abraham &amp; his group show

00:02:47.900 --> 00:02:49.510
up before the Governor attack the prison?

00:02:49.510 --> 00:02:53.210
I don’t think it would have changed anything,
it would have just gotten a little bloodier.

00:02:53.210 --> 00:02:59.020
Abraham only had 3 people and it would have
taken a small army to keep the governor from

00:02:59.020 --> 00:03:04.030
attacking with that tank.

00:03:04.030 --> 00:03:08.621
Question 6 - David Mejia asks Carol, Tyreese
and the girls went one way, and Daryl and

00:03:08.621 --> 00:03:13.710
Beth went the other, right?﻿

00:03:13.710 --> 00:03:20.630
Yes, Carol and Tyreese headed toward the sanctuary
and daryl and beth went in the opposite direction.

00:03:20.630 --> 00:03:24.830
Question 7 - shiskarobb asks Why didn't they
have an emergency meeting place?

00:03:24.830 --> 00:03:30.221
I think because part of the prison arc the
first half of the season was that they had

00:03:30.221 --> 00:03:33.780
stopped being soldiers and were trying to
settle down, so there was less of a sense

00:03:33.780 --> 00:03:35.880
of urgency about where to go next.

00:03:35.880 --> 00:03:40.230
I think they expected to stay at the prison
for forever just because it was so fortified.

00:03:40.230 --> 00:03:44.810
So short answer, probably because they didn’t
think they needed one.

00:03:44.810 --> 00:03:49.280
Question 8 - Josh Redgrave asks What are you
most afraid of for this season that you don't

00:03:49.280 --> 00:03:51.390
want to happen?

00:03:51.390 --> 00:03:54.950
The hunters getting their hands on Carl.

00:03:54.950 --> 00:03:58.680
I won’t say how that goes, but you can check
out the comics.

00:03:58.680 --> 00:03:59.680
Because it is not pleasant.

00:03:59.680 --> 00:04:02.570
And the hunters in general are just an awful
bunch.

00:04:02.570 --> 00:04:07.650
Just as bad as walkers themselves.

00:04:07.650 --> 00:04:13.030
Question 9 - sixer asks Why did maggie laugh
at the end on the bus?

00:04:13.030 --> 00:04:19.340
She was still in crazy mode but she was happy
and relieved that the walkers on the bus weren’t

00:04:19.340 --> 00:04:20.340
glenn.

00:04:20.340 --> 00:04:21.340
She thought he was on the bus.

00:04:21.340 --> 00:04:23.389
So that’s why she was laughing like a maniac.

00:04:23.389 --> 00:04:30.830
Maggie can go pretty crazy.

00:04:30.830 --> 00:04:36.129
Question 10 - Careful for comic book spoilers
in this one, but it’s really good so I wanted

00:04:36.129 --> 00:04:37.580
to answer it.

00:04:37.580 --> 00:04:41.289
Cullen Bloodstone (no avatar) asks Do you
think the big thing lizzie ends up doing will

00:04:41.289 --> 00:04:46.240
happen and then will the part with carl go
down like it does in the comics.

00:04:46.240 --> 00:04:54.270
Given that the show changed what happened
to baby judith, I think they’ll change lizzie

00:04:54.270 --> 00:04:56.139
and mika’s plot line too.

00:04:56.139 --> 00:05:00.960
I think if they did it exactly like in the
comic book the audience would openly revolt.

00:05:00.960 --> 00:05:03.520
Most of the people that watch the show don’t
read the comic book.

00:05:03.520 --> 00:05:06.819
So they haven’t seen how bad things can
get.

00:05:06.819 --> 00:05:11.180
I think that Lizzie will still do something
totally effed up, but they’ll tone it down

00:05:11.180 --> 00:05:12.580
just a little.

00:05:12.580 --> 00:05:19.120
Bonus question and last one - Legend of the
untitled asks Is it possible that lizzie is

00:05:19.120 --> 00:05:21.740
the one who killed karen and david?

00:05:21.740 --> 00:05:30.430
After seeing the rabbits 
and then what she almost did to judith and

00:05:30.430 --> 00:05:33.020
connecting her to the mutilated rats in the
prison.

00:05:33.020 --> 00:05:37.999
Yes, she definitely killed karen and david
and Carol just covered for her.

00:05:37.999 --> 00:05:42.070
I think Carol will explain to someone else
eventually what happened, but only after Lizzie

00:05:42.070 --> 00:05:49.620
does something really really bad.

00:05:49.620 --> 00:06:00.270
Thanks so much everyone for submitting your
questions.

00:06:00.270 --> 00:06:01.949
This was a lot of fun as always.

